  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Class representing Function Group State defined in meta-model (ARXML). An instance of this class will represent Function Group State defined inside meta-model (ARXML). This class is intended to be an implementation specific representation, of information inside meta-model. Once created based on ARXML path, its internal value stays bounded to it for entire lifetime of a object.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
